<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Pakistan score 257 for seven v West Indies.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Pakistan score 257 for seven v West Indies.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 257 for seven in 50 overs against West Indies in their World Series limited overs match at the WACA ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 257 for seven in 50 overs (Ijaz Ahmed 94, Mohammad Wasim 53) v West Indies.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
